{
  "description": [
    "The Clockwork Dark -- declared flag vocabulary, in the Garden's",
    "dictionary shape. The validator reads this in both directions across",
    "the story's structural documents (here: data/rules/endings.yaml): a",
    "flag read there must be canon or written somewhere structural, and a",
    "flag written there must be canon or read. Shipping this file upgrades",
    "the write-only-flag advisory to an error for this story.",
    "",
    "The nf_* flags are narrative flags: quests declare them and the",
    "Storyteller sets them when the fiction earns them, so the writer is",
    "the model and the YAML only ever reads them. The quest_*_done flags",
    "are set by each quest's on_complete. saints_marked_you is written by",
    "the terminal-death rules (data/rules/death.yaml, applied by",
    "engine/game/encounter.py). collection_brass_evidence_complete is",
    "written by the collections engine off data/tables/collections.yaml.",
    "ending_gallery_unlocked is the deliberately write-only case: every",
    "ending's Seal beat sets it and only the CLIENT reads it."
  ],
